      "name": "Shadowstep",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-shadow-creature-laugh.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>While standing in a naturally occurring shadow, spend two Blood Traits and win a Static Mental Challenge against a seven-Trait difficulty to shift your position up to 50 steps to another natural shadow within line of sight, carrying your clothes and possessions. Bringing along an unwilling companion or using the power to escape restraint requires an additional Willpower Trait and winning a Physical Challenge.</p>",
        "source": "Sabbat Guide, Disciplines",
